# four AIRPAD chords, let go. one pad keeps its release (under the line). four together sit over the
# budget, so the quiet tails are cut and a fifth instrument has room. a chord still held is not cut.
budget 100
listen
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
expect nev 0
trkset 1 2 0 0
holdseed 0 1 4 200
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect voices >2
wait 1400
expect voices >2
expect voices <8
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
trkset 2 2 0 0
trkset 3 2 0 0
trkset 4 2 0 0
holdseed 0 2 4 200
holdseed 0 3 4 200
holdseed 0 4 4 200
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect voices >14
wait 1400
expect voices <14
expect voices >4
